        <title><![CDATA[India's top court tightens food warning labels in new setback for industry]]></title>
        <description><![CDATA[India’s Supreme Court ruled on Thursday that separate warning labels should appear on the front of food packaging for each nutrient of concern, tightening a government proposal which had called for a single warning label.]]></description>
        
